Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 08:16:38 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 07/15] group: Hyprland's group behaviour behind options;
 grouptoggle, groupmove

group_keep_single: a group stays a group with one window (made by the new
grouptoggle, or left when its other tabs leave); closing it is safe.
group_auto_join: a new tiled window opened from a group's shown tab joins
the group right after that tab (group:auto_group, insert_after_current).
group_focus_wrap: groupfocus goes round from the last tab to the first.
grouptoggle: Hyprland's togglegroup - a lone window becomes a group of one, a
window in a group breaks the whole group up and keeps the focus.
groupmove next|prev: Hyprland's movegroupwindow - the focused tab swaps
places with its neighbour, at the ends with the tab at the other end.
